<announcement-banner/>
<view class="benefits-page"><view class="page-heading">卡券与仿真币</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="retry">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><block wx:if="{{info}}">
 <view class="coin-hero"><view class="hero-label">我的仿真币余额</view><view class="balance">{{info.balance}}</view><view class="hero-description">可抵扣 ¥{{info.deductible}} · 100仿真币 = 1元</view><view class="hero-actions"><button bindtap="signin">每日签到 +8</button><button class="invite-button" bindtap="invite">邀请好友赚币</button></view></view>
 <view class="coin-stats"><view><text>{{info.earned}}</text>累计获得</view><view><text>{{info.used}}</text>已使用（扣除退回）</view><view><text>{{info.frozen}}</text>支付冻结中</view></view>
 <view class="section-title">怎么赚仿真币</view><view class="task" bindtap="signin"><view class="task-icon">签到</view><view class="grow"><view>每天来看看</view><view class="caption">北京时间每天限领一次</view></view><text class="task-amount">+8币 ›</text></view><view class="task" bindtap="invite"><view class="task-icon">邀请</view><view class="grow"><view>邀请好友注册与完成首单</view><view class="caption">个人二维码、链接与微信好友分享</view></view><text class="task-amount">+50~300币 ›</text></view><view class="task" bindtap="signin"><view class="task-icon">完单</view><view class="grow"><view>完成订单与成就任务</view><view class="caption">每单500币，成就奖励按任务领取</view></view><text class="task-amount">查看 ›</text></view>
 <view class="section-title">仿真币能做什么</view><view class="usage-grid"><view class="usage-card" bindtap="use"><image src="/assets/icons-contrast/orders.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><view>订单支付抵扣</view><text>支付页开启仿真币抵扣，减少现金应付金额</text></view><view class="usage-card" bindtap="use"><image src="/assets/icons-contrast/eye.svg" mode="aspectFit"/><view>购买需求曝光</view><text>曝光费19元/100人，可使用仿真币抵扣</text></view></view>
 <view class="section-title">仿真币使用说明</view><view class="usage-rules"><view>100仿真币抵扣1元，1币对应0.01元；抵扣不超过可用余额和本次应付金额。</view><view>下单时选择使用，先冻结相应仿真币；支付成功后扣除。确认取消支付单或支付超时后释放。</view><view>退款中的仿真币按抵扣部分原路退回，现金退款以平台处理结果为准；曝光已推流部分不自动退款。</view><view>仿真币为站内营销权益，不可提现、转让或兑换现金。优惠券抵扣暂未启用，领取的卡券仍保留。</view></view>
 <view class="section-title">活动礼包</view><view class="offer" wx:for="{{info.offers}}" wx:key="key"><view class="grow"><view>{{item.title}}</view><text>{{item.amountText}}</text></view><button data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="claim" disabled="{{busy||item.claimed}}">{{item.claimed?'已领取':'领取'}}</button></view>
 <view class="ledger-tabs"><view class="{{tab==='coins'?'active':''}}" data-tab="coins" bindtap="tab">收支明细</view><view class="{{tab==='coupons'?'active':''}}" data-tab="coupons" bindtap="tab">我的卡券</view></view>
 <block wx:if="{{tab==='coins'}}"><view class="ledger-row" wx:for="{{info.coins}}" wx:key="id"><view><view>{{item.label}}</view><text>{{item.time}}</text></view><text class="ledger-amount {{item.income?'income':'expense'}}">{{item.amountText}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!info.coins.length}}" class="empty">暂无仿真币收支记录</view></block>
 <block wx:else><view class="coupon {{item.status}}" wx:for="{{info.coupons}}" wx:key="id"><view class="coupon-value">¥{{item.amount}}</view><view class="grow"><view>{{item.title}}</view><text>满 ¥{{item.min}} · {{item.expiresText}} 到期</text><text>{{item.status==='EXPIRED'?'已过期':'已领取 · 抵扣待启用'}}</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{!info.coupons.length}}" class="empty">暂无卡券</view></block><button wx:if="{{info.nextOffset!==null}}" class="more" bindtap="more">加载更多</button>
</block></view>
